    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Skills Pair &amp; Recommendation'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontname='Tableau Bold'>Skills Pair &amp; Recommendation</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1200' minheight='900' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource caption='skill_pairs' name='federated.120tt5r1540p6v1ayzjce1hnnqi8' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.120tt5r1540p6v1ayzjce1hnnqi8'>
        <column-instance column='[skill_1]' derivation='None' name='[none:skill_1:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[skill_2]' derivation='None' name='[none:skill_2:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column caption='Skill 1' datatype='string' name='[skill_1]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
        <column caption='Skill 2' datatype='string' name='[skill_2]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98222' id='13' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='889'>
            <zone h='4556' id='14' type-v2='title' w='98666' x='667' y='889'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='93666' id='7' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='5445'>
              <zone h='93666' id='5' type-v2='layout-basic' w='85333' x='667' y='5445'>
                <zone h='53296' id='3' name='Skills pair' w='85333' x='667' y='5445'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='40370' id='11' type-v2='text' w='85333' x='667' y='58741'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>1. Learn SQL first.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> 45% of fresher analyst postings ask for it, rising to 65% at mid level. About 4 in 5 Power BI or Tableau postings also ask for it.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>2. Make Excel and statistics your baseline.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> About 42% and 45% of fresher postings ask for them, at every level.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>3. Add one BI tool.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> Power BI goes from 23% of fresher postings to 50% of senior ones, and Tableau from 20% to 40%. Either works, so pick one and build projects with it.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>4. Add Python after that.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> It’s in 34% of fresher analyst postings, against 80% of data scientist postings.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>5. Start with the biggest hiring cities.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> Bengaluru has 45% of jobs that name a city, then Delhi NCR (15%), Hyderabad (9%) and Pune (8.5%). Remote roles are a further market.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='160' h='93666' id='6' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='13333' x='86000' y='5445'>
